      "pinyin": "lì lì kǒu kě le duì xiǎo yǔ shuō wǒ men yì rén mǎi yì bēi nǎi chá hē ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili got thirsty, and said to Little Yu: “Let’s each buy a cup of milk tea!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨想了想，说：“我们买一杯吧！我减肥，喝一口就好了。”",
      "traditional": "小雨想了想，說：“我們買一杯吧！我減肥，喝一口就好了。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ xiǎng le xiǎng shuō wǒ men mǎi yì bēi ba wǒ jiǎn féi hē yì kǒu jiù hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu thought for a bit, and said: “Let’s just get one cup! I’m on a diet, and only need one mouthful.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽说：“我们还是一人一杯吧！上次你喝了一口，就已经没有奶茶了。”",
      "traditional": "麗麗說：“我們還是一人一杯吧！上次你喝了一口，就已經沒有奶茶了。”",
      "pinyin": "lì lì shuō wǒ men hái shi yì rén yì bēi ba shàng cì nǐ hē le yì kǒu jiù yǐ jīng méi yǒu nǎi chá le",
